:: D4_List [document]
<div class="doc">
<span class="stamp stamp--red"><<ru "sov-sekretno" "СОВ. СЕКРЕТНО">></span>
<span class="stamp stamp--violet">ПАКЕТ 7/С</span>
<div class="doc-header"><span class="doc-org">Перечень мероприятий</span><span class="doc-sub">List of measures · prepared 14.08.91 · copy 2</span></div>
<p class="doc-title">Measures for the first day (“Day X”)</p>

1. From 06:00, broadcast the Appeal and the Committee's statements on all central radio and television channels. Replace scheduled programming.

2. Suspend publication of all central and Moscow <<ru "gazeta" "newspapers">> except those on the attached list (Appendix 1). Seal the editorial offices of <em>Moscow News</em>, <em>Kuranty</em>, <em>Nezavisimaya Gazeta</em> … <<note "press-suspended">>

3. The Secretariat of the Central Committee to dispatch instructions to regional Party committees (draft attached, reg. 0417/с).

4. Ensure the telephone and telegraph connection of the Crimean residence is “temporarily unavailable.”

5. Persons requiring “special attention” are listed in Appendix 2. <span class="redacted">████████ ████████████ ██████ ███████████</span>

<p class="margin-note">Г.И. — список №2 уничтожить после исполнения.</p>
<p class="doc-translation">Handwritten: “G.I. — destroy list no. 2 after execution.” G.I. are Rudin's initials.</p>
<div class="doc-footer"><em>Fictional document created for this game.</em> It is modeled on the kinds of measures the State Committee actually carried out on 19 August: the broadcasts, the newspaper ban and Gorbachev's isolation. No such list from the Central Committee's General Department is known to exist.</div>
<<returnlink>>
</div>
